#: includes/class-license-manager.php:427
msgid "Asset Library (cliparts & fonts)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:428
msgid "Benefit: give buyers a curated set of cliparts and fonts to design with. Flow: you upload the assets once → they appear inside the designer → buyers pick from them while customising."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:433
msgid "Option performance analytics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:434
msgid "Benefit: see which options and variants actually sell so you can sharpen pricing and your catalogue. Flow: buyers choose options → Storelly aggregates the picks → you read a performance report."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:439
msgid "Pricing config version history"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:440
msgid "Benefit: change pricing fearlessly — every version is kept. Flow: you edit an option/pricing set → a snapshot is saved automatically → roll back to any earlier version if something breaks."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:445
msgid "Branded invoice & statement PDFs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:446
msgid "Benefit: send professional, on-brand B2B paperwork. Flow: a B2B order or billing period closes → generate a branded invoice or statement PDF → send it to the client."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:451
msgid "Scheduled B2B emails (dunning, statements)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:452
msgid "Benefit: get paid faster without chasing clients by hand. Flow: you set a schedule → Storelly sends payment reminders and statements to B2B clients automatically at the right time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:457
msgid "B2B account analytics (aging, DSO)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-license-manager.php:458
msgid "Benefit: keep cash flow healthy per account. Flow: B2B invoices accrue → Storelly computes aging buckets and DSO → you monitor who owes what and how late."
